<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL: STOCK TRADES EX-DIV TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL: STOCK TRADES EX-DIV TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
